re.steampowered.com/app/610190/","fetchedAt":"2026-10-16T09:32:26.715080+00:00","locales":{"en":{"status":"source","provider":"steam","shortDescription":"A battle of heroes where everyone is the lead! The very first all-stars title for Koei Tecmo! For the first time in Warriors series, flashy action combines both the traits of the original series and new exiting elements such as “Musou Rush”, open scenarios and multiple endings!","detailedDescription":"Crossover characters are from these games:\n\nNioh: Complete Edition\nDYNASTY WARRIORS 9\nDynasty Warriors 8 Empires\nDynasty Warriors 8 Xtreme Legends Complete Edition\nDYNASTY WARRIORS 7: Xtreme Legends Definitive Edition\nToukiden 2\nToukiden: Kiwami\nAtelier Sophie: The Alchemist of the Mysterious Book DX\nAtelier Sophie 2: The Alchemist of the Mysterious Dream\nSAMURAI WARRIORS: Spirit of Sanada\nSAMURAI WARRIORS 4-II\nNINJA GAIDEN: Master Collection\nDEAD OR ALIVE 6\nNights of Azure\n\nThe truly ultimate \"WARRIORS OROCHI 3\" is now available on Steam!\n\nAbout the Game\nA battle of heroes where everyone is the lead!  The very first all-star title of Koei Tecmo! \nThe rousing action essential to \"Warriors\" series is powered up with new elements, such as open scenarios and multiple endings!  Impressive assembly of 30 characters backed up by the original voice actors, and action that combines both familiar traits of the original series and new exiting elements like “Musou Rush”.\nFurthermore, each character and their progression are drawn vividly, through special strengths and effects, known as “Hero Skills,” and the ways story and interactions change based on the battles they fight. \nEnjoy the epic story of collaboration of heroes that brakes the borders of diverse range of worlds!","aboutGame":"A battle of heroes where everyone is the lead!  The very first all-star title of Koei Tecmo! \n\r\nThe rousing action essential to \"Warriors\" series is powered up with new elements, such as open scenarios and multiple endings!  Impressive assembly of 30 characters backed up by the original voice actors, and action that combines both familiar traits of the original series and new exiting elements like “Musou Rush”.\n\r\nFurthermore, each character and their progression are drawn vividly, through special strengths and effects, known as “Hero Skills,” and the ways story and interactions change based on the battles they fight. \n\r\nEnjoy the epic story of collaboration of heroes that brakes the borders of diverse range of worlds!"},"vi":{"status":"pending_translation","provider":null,"shortDescription":null,"detailedDescription":null,"aboutGame":null}},"media":{"images":[{"role":"header","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/610190/header.jpg?t=1760594557"},{"role":"capsule","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/610190/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760594557"}],"screenshots":[{"id":0,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/610190/ss_1ee58860eed051af71fd1e0b45d29c0602ca3288.600x338.jpg?t=1760594557","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/610190/ss_1ee58860eed051af71fd1e0b45d29c0602ca3288.1920x1080.jpg?t=1760594557"},{"id":1,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/610190/ss_0768d390b2cc376e506a07df77a1970cb32ebf59.600x338.jpg?t=1760594557","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/610190/ss_0768d390b2cc376e506a07df77a1970cb32ebf59.1920x1080.jpg?t=1760594557"},{"id":2,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/610190/ss_6694c0a5a065f4b6d38a5a3a6c77785e507f4f4f.600x338.jpg?t=1760594557","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/610190/ss_6694c0a5a065f4b6d38a5a3a6c77785e507f4f4f.1920x1080.jpg?t=1760594557"},{"id":3,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/61019